flowchart TD
    A[Principal Request] --> B{Direct Grant?}
    B -->|Yes| C{Direct Deny?}
    B -->|No| D{Role Grant?}
    C -->|Yes| E[Deny Access]
    C -->|No| F[Allow Access]
    D -->|Yes| G{Role Deny?}
    D -->|No| H[No Access]
    G -->|Yes| E
    G -->|No| F
    I[Revoke] --> J[Remove Grant]
    J --> D

